    c8000000 c9000000

fail "list of objects with arrays of Bools from an embedded file holding 7", "`extend_from_bytes` reads whole `Grid`s from \"grid.bin\": field `rows[1].marks[0]` of record 0 (byte 2) holds 7, and a `Bool` is only 0 or 1"
